{
 "_report": "Halo on the V3 kit. Arrive at the Cloud Dock (kept, hall + airship cabin) -> Skyreach Plaza (kept town core; Recovery Bay 116 and Shop 117 swapped to the kit rooms with counters and pinned nurse/clerk). Sky Crossroads is the town hub: north Skyreach Quiet Court (houses, Cloud Garden Room), east Skyreach Lane Homes (houses, Oracle Library) and the Halo Spaceport (gate home), south the main route Sky Temple Overlook -> Floating Gardens (kit Petal Meadow, M16:1 moved here) -> Cloudbreak Edge -> Temple Junction. Temple Junction: east the Sky Temple (kit Relay Tower; old 121/122 ids reused for Trial Floor and Crystal Hall, keeper object restored, M16:2 stays on 122) and beyond it the Sky Colosseum (lobby -> battle floor -> grand ring); west Cloud Fork (north Crystal Hollow cave, 3 floors; south Shrine Hollows dead end with chest; west the Hidden Blossom Grove with chest); south Cloud River Bend -> Windstep Rise -> Skyfarm Edge (farm hamlet, chapel). Old Wind Bridges A/B and Floating Gardens (118-120) dropped; NPCs and wild tables moved.",
